@startuml State_GensolJob
!theme plain
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
}

title State Diagram: Trang thai GensolJob (BKDNOJ moi)

[*] --> PENDING : Admin tao job

state "PENDING" as PENDING : Job da tao\ncho Bridge nhan

state "GENERATING_INPUT" as GEN_IN : Dang chay Generator\nSinh input data\ntung test case

state "GENERATING_OUTPUT" as GEN_OUT : Dang chay Solution\nSinh expected output\ntung test case

state "UPLOADING" as UPLOAD : Dang upload\ntest cases vao\nProblemData

state "DONE" as DONE : Hoan tat\nTat ca test cases\nda duoc tao

state "ERROR" as ERROR : Loi xay ra\nGhi nhan error_message\nva error_testcase

PENDING --> GEN_IN : start_gensol_job\n(gensol-request, step=generator)

GEN_IN --> GEN_IN : Moi test case:\nchay generator\nluu inputs/<n>.txt
GEN_IN --> GEN_OUT : grading-end (generator)\non_gensol_grading_end\n-> _transition_to_solution

GEN_IN --> ERROR : Generator TLE/MLE/RTE\n(on_gensol_error)

GEN_OUT --> GEN_OUT : Moi test case:\nchay solution\nluu outputs/<n>.txt
GEN_OUT --> UPLOAD : grading-end (solution)\non_gensol_grading_end\n-> _finalize_job

GEN_OUT --> ERROR : Solution TLE/MLE/RTE

UPLOAD --> DONE : Build zip cuoi (in+out)\nUpload ProblemTestCase\n(size <= 64MB)

UPLOAD --> ERROR : Zip qua lon\nhoac loi upload

DONE --> [*]
ERROR --> [*]

note right of GEN_IN
  **WebSocket channel:**
  gensol_<id_secret>
  (HMAC-SHA512)

  **Dieu phoi:** Bridge goi
  judge/utils/gensol.py
  (KHONG dung Redis signal)
end note

@enduml
